6.3 Referential Integrity
Every philosopher.argument_id must exist in philosophical_argument.

Every premise.argument_id must exist in philosophical_argument.

Every assumption.argument_id must exist in philosophical_argument.

Every objection.argument_id must exist in philosophical_argument.

Every response.argument_id must exist in philosophical_argument.

Every term.argument_id must exist in philosophical_argument.

Every argument_relation.argument_id and argument_relation.related_argument_id must exist in philosophical_argument.

Every work_link.argument_id must exist in philosophical_argument.

Every student_argument_link.argument_id must exist in philosophical_argument.

Every provenance.argument_id must exist in philosophical_argument.

Every moderation.argument_id must exist in philosophical_argument.

The version chain must be acyclic.

The argument relation must be symmetric where appropriate.

Every response.target_objection_id must exist in objection.

