12. Validation Engine Design
The graph validates the following.

Validation 1. Argument validity. Every argument is validated against the schema.

Validation 2. Referential integrity.

Validation 3. Version chain acyclicity.

Validation 4. Work resolution.

Validation 5. Student argument resolution.

Validation 6. Provenance completeness.

Validation 7. Audit completeness.

Validation 8. Moderation completeness.

Validation 9. Response target consistency. Every response target must exist.

Validation 10. Validity consistency. The validity must be consistent with the argument form.

Validation 11. Soundness consistency. The soundness must be consistent with the validity and the premises.

Validation 12. Objection target consistency. Every objection target must exist.

